   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br><strong>Enhances:</strong> Subdermal Armor<br><strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances Subdermal Armor. Any Cyberdeck in the user's Neuroport Cyberdeck Port gets one more Hardware Option Slot, as though this were a Bodyweight Suit. It doesn't stack with other Bodyweight Suits.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p><ul><li>The extra slot belongs to the Cyberdeck, not to this item, so it isn't applied automatically.</li></ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; External Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
